      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\nChanges the background of the card\n\n**cssclasses decorations**:\n- For transparency, use:\n\t- cc-card-transparent\n- For a level of opacity, use:\n\t- cc-card-opaque\n- No color in the background\n\t- cc-card-nocolor\n- Use an image background:\n\t- cc-image-clip\n\t- cc-image-cover",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 411,
      "x": 678,
      "y": -429
    },
