      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\nRotates a card by 45 degrees, or the text within a card by various degrees\n\n**cssclasses decorations**\n - cc-rotate-card-45\n - cc-rotate-text-45\n - cc-rotate-text-90\n - cc-rotate-text-135\n - cc-rotate-text-180\n - cc-rotate-text-225\n - cc-rotate-text-270\n - cc-rotate-text-315\n - cc-rotate-text-360\n \n\n\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 305,
