    {
      "height": 61,
      "id": "5b75bb2166162e18",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n# Basic shapes\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 342,
      "x": 664,
      "y": 647
    },
    {
      "height": 307,
      "id": "c694537bd22b78a1",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\n- Simple shapes often used in Flowcharting\n\n**cssclasses decorations**\n- For a circle: \n\t- cc-shape-circle\n- For a parallelogram: \n\t- cc-shape-parallelogram-left\n\t- cc-shape-parallelogram-right\n\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 401,
      "x": 686,
      "y": 728
    },
    {
      "color": "3",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "a89fdabed38042fb",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-shape-circle, cc-card-center\n---\n\n##### Circle \n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 162,
      "x": 1093,
      "y": 738
    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 130,
      "id": "46013e4660553fd4",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-shape-circle, cc-border-none, cc-card-center\n---\n\n**Ellipse** \n(stretched circle with no border) \n\n",
