      "height": 515,
      "id": "40758530f83acaa2",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\nApplies a gradient background to the card, using the card's selected color. using the \"deg\" or degree suffix on the class determines the angle of the gradiante.\n\n**cssclasses decorations**\n- cc-card-gradient-0deg\n- cc-card-gradient-45deg\n- cc-card-gradient-90deg\n- cc-card-gradient-135deg\n- cc-card-gradient-180deg\n- cc-card-gradient-225deg\n- cc-card-gradient-270deg\n- cc-card-gradient-315deg",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 461,
      "x": 1724,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 140,
      "id": "fa148a503e5c4faa",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-card-gradient-45deg\n---\n\ncc-card-gradient-45deg\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 2311,
      "y": 215
    },
    {
      "color": "6",
      "height": 120,
      "id": "f4f160522e5a14d4",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-card-gradient-270deg\n---\n\ncc-card-gradient-270deg\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 300,
      "x": 2241,
      "y": 398
    },
    {
      "height": 59,
      "id": "7fbf175a21c63a3b",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n# Rotation\n\n>[!cc-card-transparent]",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 563,
      "x": 1713,
      "y": 655
    },
    {
      "color": "#151414",
      "height": 6,
