    },
    {
      "color": "4",
      "height": 198,
      "id": "db438dabda0b0449",
      "text": "Text not centered\n\n>[!cc-callout-center]\n>Centered callout contents\n\nMore text not centered",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 406,
      "x": 1183,
      "y": 140
    },
    {
      "height": 452,
      "id": "79804f02d531672a",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n#### Description\nCenter of contents or a callout in a card. Not all content centers properly, so experimentation is required.\n\n**callout decorations*:\n- Center the contents of a callout in the card. The title of the callout is not shown, just its contents. This provides a way to center some content in a card independent of the other markdown in the card.\n\t- cc-callout-center\n\n**cssclasses decorations**\n- Center the contents of the card \n\t- cc-card-center\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 461,
      "x": 673,
      "y": 146
    },
    {
      "color": "5",
      "height": 205,
      "id": "ee48ef26cc0447d8",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-card-center\n---\n\nCenter content\n- Line 1\n- Line 2\n- Line 3\n",
      "type": "text",
      "width": 313,
      "x": 1172,
      "y": 359
    },
    {
      "height": 71,
      "id": "10e5f3379ab647d9",
      "text": "---\ncssclasses: cc-border-none, cc-card-transparent\n---\n\n# Gradiants",
